links: ["PLAN-935"]

### Auto
path: "main.at"

~~~~auto
fn pick<T>(n int, seed T) T {
    if n <= 0 { return seed }
    return pick(n - 1, seed)
}
fn main() int {
    return pick(2, 40)
}
~~~~

